  "content_html": "<h2 id=\"3.-company---business,-marketing-công-ty---kinh-doanh,-marketing\">3. Company - Business, Marketing (Công ty - Kinh doanh, Marketing)</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"3.1.-đặc-điểm-chung\">3.1. Đặc điểm chung</h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<div>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:none; width:624px\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000000; border-left:1px solid #000000; border-right:1px solid #000000; border-top:1px solid #000000; vertical-align:top; width:179px\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center\">Nội dung&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000000; border-left:1px solid #000000; border-right:1px solid #000000; border-top:1px solid #000000; vertical-align:top; width:445px\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Di chuyển: sắp xếp đi lại, trợ cấp chi phí di chuyển khi đi công tác,...</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Công việc: làm hợp đồng kinh doanh, tư vấn khách hàng, cân đối ngân sách,...</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Sản phẩm: nghiên cứu thị trường, chiến lược tiếp thị sản phẩm mới, quảng cáo cho sản phẩm mới,...</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000000; border-left:1px solid #000000; border-right:1px solid #000000; border-top:1px solid #000000; vertical-align:top; width:179px\">\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center\">Người nói&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #000000; border-left:1px solid #000000; border-right:1px solid #000000; border-top:1px solid #000000; vertical-align:top; width:445px\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Đồng nghiệp</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Cấp trên - Cấp dưới&nbsp;</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li style=\"list-style-type:disc\">Người phụ trách - Khách hàng (của công ty)</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"3.2.-ví-dụ\">3.2. Ví dụ&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<p>Audio: ETS 2022 - Test 3 - Q44-46</p>\n\n<div class=\"ckeditor-html5-audio\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div tabindex=\"0\" class=\"plyr plyr--full-ui plyr--audio plyr--html5 plyr--paused plyr--stopped\" style=\"z-index: 100;\"><div class=\"plyr__controls\"><button class=\"plyr__controls__item plyr__control\" type=\"button\" data-plyr=\"play\" aria-label=\"Play\"><svg class=\"icon--pressed\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#plyr-pause\"></use></svg><svg class=\"icon--not-pressed\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#plyr-play\"></use></svg><span class=\"label--pressed plyr__tooltip\">Pause</span><span class=\"label--not-pressed plyr__tooltip\">Play</span></button><div class=\"plyr__controls__item plyr__progress__container\"><div class=\"plyr__progress\"><input data-plyr=\"seek\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"Seek\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"80.541125\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" id=\"plyr-seek-1066\" aria-valuetext=\"00:00 of 00:00\" style=\"--value: 0%;\"><progress class=\"plyr__progress__buffer\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"83.09171246366375\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">% buffered</progress><span class=\"plyr__tooltip\">00:00</span></div></div><div class=\"plyr__controls__item plyr__time--current plyr__time\" aria-label=\"Current time\">01:20</div><div class=\"plyr__controls__item plyr__volume\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"plyr__control\" data-plyr=\"mute\"><svg class=\"icon--pressed\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#plyr-muted\"></use></svg><svg class=\"icon--not-pressed\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#plyr-volume\"></use></svg><span class=\"label--pressed plyr__tooltip\">Unmute</span><span class=\"label--not-pressed plyr__tooltip\">Mute</span></button><input data-plyr=\"volume\" type=\"range\" m